  "gameDescriptionHtml": "\n<b>You receive a job from a dealer</b> and learn that a group of archaeologists has discovered an ancient tomb in an abandoned mine near the city! Now you must get inside and <b>steal the ancient artifacts</b> to sell them.<p></p>\n<p>You will have to explore the forest surroundings and the tomb to find anything valuable. Since you are an experienced thief, you have an active skill called “<b>Thief’s Instinct</b>.” It highlights tracks and important items! <b>Keep that in mind!</b></p>\n<p><b>Pretty Good graphics</b> and <b>surround sound</b> completely immerse you in the eerie atmosphere of this mysterious place!</p>\n<p><b><i>Mara</i></b> isn’t your typical first-person indie horror. You won’t find tons of loud jumpscares here. I wanted to create a small, interesting, dark, and sometimes funny story, so I focused more on the overall atmosphere rather than fear.<br>\n</p>",
